# Everything under tools/testbench/ is deployed to and EXECUTED ON the
# bench Pi (Linux). This repo is worked on from Windows with
# core.autocrlf=true, which checks these out as CRLF — and a shell script
# with CRLF fails on the Pi in a maximally confusing way: `set -e` becomes
# `set: -: invalid option`, `cd .` becomes `cd $'.\r'`, and an install(1)
# target picks up a trailing CR so files land under a CR-named path
# instead of the real one (seen 2026-07-31).
#
# Pin LF so a Windows checkout still produces deployable files.
*.sh        text eol=lf
*.rules     text eol=lf
*.service   text eol=lf
*.py        text eol=lf

# extensionless Pi-side executables (tools/testbench/pi/)
bench-health      text eol=lf
bench-recover     text eol=lf
bench-radio-reset text eol=lf
